MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

From a live unit's u-boot session: 1 GiB DRAM (not 512 MB — likely variants;
DTS unaffected, read from bootloader), authoritative mtdparts with offsets
(two 111M A/B rootfs slots), machid 0x8010006, u-boot 2.0.0. Secure boot:
console fully open + zero sec/auth/fuse env vars -> near-confirmed not fused,
final proof = unsigned bootm.
